{"id":"n24647-1-13","stage":3,"title":"죄 · 罪","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24647-1-13-1","ko":"저 여자는 왜 경찰에 잡혀 왔어요?","zh":"那个女人为什么会被警察抓来啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"여자는","meaning":"女子，女人","explanation":"여자：女子，女人；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여자는","audio":"/audio/a356b569613a3a24fc74.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"경찰에","meaning":"警方，警察当局","explanation":"경찰：警方，警察当局；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"경찰","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25949","senseId":"1","lemma":"경찰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경찰에","audio":"/audio/33c2ff329cc318efacb2.mp3"}},{"text":"잡혀","meaning":"被抓，被捕","explanation":"잡히다：被抓，被捕；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잡히다","audio":"/audio/4e82277a09474ac2305e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70656","senseId":"13","lemma":"잡히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡혀","audio":"/audio/f857f0e475f012b72a0a.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어요?","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어요","audio":"/audio/2ef5daa5f516291289bc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女子，女人","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"作为女性出生的人。","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"642315305ad78197","term":"경찰","zh":"警方，警察当局","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3","entryId":"25949","definition":"维持社会秩序、保护人民生命和财产安全；或指负责此事的国家机关。","pronunciation":["경ː찰"]},{"id":"4e82277a09474ac2","term":"잡히다","zh":"被抓，被捕","audio":"/audio/4e82277a09474ac2305e.mp3","entryId":"70656","definition":"被捉住放在手里。","pronunciation":["자피다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9028bdac43510aefc163.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24647-1-13-2","ko":"다른 사람의 물건을 훔친 죄로 경찰에 잡혀 왔어요.","zh":"她因为偷了别人的东西而被警察抓来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的。","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"사람의","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람의","audio":"/audio/1f4d8dd29cf5a474eb64.mp3"}},{"text":"물건을","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","reading